        "text": "24"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Count by the base",
        "body": "Five lines meet at the top vertex (the vertical side, three inner lines and the hypotenuse). Triangles whose base is on the bottom line: choose 2 of the 5 lines, $\\binom52=10$. Triangles whose base is on the short horizontal segment: it meets the vertical side and the next three lines, so choose 2 of these 4 lines, $\\binom42=6$.\n\nTotal $10+6=16$.\n\n**Answer: (B) 16**"
      }
    ],
