        "title": "Common divisor",
        "body": "The number of girls divides both 150 and 105. $150=2\\cdot3\\cdot5^2$ and $105=3\\cdot5\\cdot7$, so the greatest common divisor is $3\\cdot5=15$.\n\n**Answer: (D) 15**"
      }
