        "body": "$\\left(1-\\frac1k\\right)=\\frac{k-1}{k}$, so the product is $\\frac45\\cdot\\frac56\\cdot\\frac67\\cdots\\frac{399}{400}=\\frac4{400}=\\frac1{100}$. Its square root is $\\frac1{10}$.\n\n**Answer: (D) $\\frac1{10}$**"
