      {
        "title": "Try both orientations",
        "body": "All tiles must point the same way.\n\n- 25 cm along the 710 side: $\\lfloor710/25\\rfloor=28$; 20 cm along 430: $\\lfloor430/20\\rfloor=21$; total $28\\times21=588$.\n- 20 cm along the 710 side: $\\lfloor710/20\\rfloor=35$; 25 cm along 430: $\\lfloor430/25\\rfloor=17$; total $35\\times17=595$.\n\nThe maximum is 595.\n\n**Answer: (C) 595**"
