    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Find the digit pattern",
        "body": "$65^2=4225$, $665^2=442225$, $6665^2=44422225$. Each extra 6 in $x$ adds one 4 and one 2 to $x^2$, so the digit sum rises by 6. With $s$ sixes, $\\#[x^2]=7+6s$.\n\n$7+6s=49$ gives $s=7$, so $x=66\\,666\\,665$ (seven 6s then a 5).\n\n**Answer: (D) 66 666 665**"
      }
