    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Opposite faces",
        "body": "In the strip of four squares, diamond and heart are opposite, and club and smiley are opposite. The two end squares (euro above the smiley and spade below the diamond) are the top and bottom, so euro and spade are opposite.\n\nCube (1) shows heart and diamond together, cube (2) shows spade and euro together, and cube (4) shows club and smiley together: each is impossible. Cubes (3) and (5) show three mutually adjacent faces and the clockwise order of the faces around the corner agrees with the net, so they can be obtained.\n\nSo exactly cubes (1), (2) and (4) cannot be obtained.\n\n**Answer: (D)**"
